{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"meaning_history/senses/1/status\",\"value_json\":\"\\\"current\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"meaning_history/senses/1/text\",\"value_json\":\"菜 is used for prepared food or a dish. Qin-period slips reportedly spell the vegetable word with 采, and later Chinese evidence records collective uses for dishes; Japanese sources separately cite a side-dish use around 1120. The evidence does not establish a sequence from vegetables to dishes.\"},{\"path\":\"meaning_history/senses/1/evidence_ids\",\"value_json\":\"[\\\"ref013\\\",\\\"ref014\\\",\\\"ref015\\\",\\\"ref020\\\",\\\"ref029\\\",\\\"ref030\\\",\\\"ref037\\\"]\"}]}"}}
